1
00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:12,916
What the heck is this supposed to be?

2
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:17,977
You think you're funny putting black ink
all over my spaghetti, is that right?

3
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,707
No, no, no, sir, not at all.

4
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,737
This is called a narrow de sapia.

5
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:25,717
It is a classic pasta dish made with
fresh squid ink, hence the color.

6
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,630
Really?

7
00:00:26,713 --> 00:00:28,500
It's quite delicious. Hmm.

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,340
Say, this is delicious!

9
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,420
This hotel used to be a place
of class and refinement.

10
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,860
Now they let just anyone in here.

11
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:55,840
Signorina, accept this,
a token of your beauty.

12
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,140
It's beautiful!

13
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,300
Not as much as you.

14
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,217
When you remove this at night,

15
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:04,829
