be together in your dreams.

16
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,240
Come on!

17
00:01:06,620 --> 00:01:09,937
Did that mozzarella cheese wall
just say what I think he said?

18
00:01:10,020 --> 00:01:14,880
I shall cast an enchantment upon
it, just a little love spell?

19
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:18,731
and then you will have no choice
but to fall to my passion.

20
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,357
You've got to be kidding!

21
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:23,028
This guy is making me sick!

22
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:29,100
And I shall spread my chum's magic
to those delicious lips of yours.

23
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:30,920
That's just ridiculous!

24
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:34,177
How could any modern woman
fall for such an obvious act?

25
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,090
Disgusting!

26
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,780
I have an idea.

27
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,920
Harmon de sepia.

28
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:46,458
This should stick to that little
Casanova's enchanting face for a bit.

29
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:57,400
How did he just do that?

30
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:02,160
That, that was Hamon.

31
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,240
Yes, I'm sure of it.

32
00:02:04,740 --> 00:02:08,137
Pardon the intrusion, but there
is a phone call from a Mr.

33
00:02:08,220 --> 00:02:10,180
Speedwagon, Mr. Caesar Zeppeli.

34
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:14,280
Mamma mia, I will be right
there. What? What the?

35
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:17,737
That spaghetti-brained womanizer is the

36
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:20,644
Caesar Zeppeli we came
all the way here to find?

37
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:35,300
I don't know.

38
00:02:58,920 --> 00:02:59,750
Thank you.

39
00:03:57,820 --> 00:04:00,377
This is the Speed Wagon Foundation.

40
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:05,497
This complex was built 28 years ago with
funds from the Ample Speed Wagon fortune.

41
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:09,437
Here all manners of science, medicine,

42
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:12,337
archaeology and more are
generously funded and

43
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:15,457
exhaustively researched for
the benefit of all humankind.

44
00:04:15,540 --> 00:04:17,037
But the foundation?

45
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:19,360
also houses a darker purpose.

46
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:24,160
One to unlock the secret
of the stone masks.

47
00:04:25,220 --> 00:04:26,877
The UV lights are very powerful.

48
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,489
Please, if you don't mind.

49
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:31,900
Introduce the snake.

50
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:44,280
It was absorbed into the stone.

51
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,477
Son Viento still isn't dead.

52
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,736
His body is defending itself somehow.

53
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:51,297
What if he finds some
way to awaken in there?

54
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:52,360
This can't be.

55
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,497
We must find a way to destroy him.

56
00:04:54,580 --> 00:04:56,597
The monster fleets on masked vampires.

57
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,377
He's immortal for all we know.

58
00:04:58,460 --> 00:05:00,048
What are we supposed to do?

59
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,420
Don't worry, Mr.

60
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,350
Speedwagon.

61
00:05:02,433 --> 00:05:03,263
He can't do anything.

62
00:05:03,346 --> 00:05:05,317
As long as he's under those UV lights,

63
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:08,576
