done here, I'll take care of it!

126
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,640
Thank you kindly!

127
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:22,980
You bastard!

128
00:08:23,380 --> 00:08:25,480
You gave this woman a Hamon kiss!

129
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:31,060
Like I just said, your weak Hamon
couldn't even defeat a woman. Sad.

130
00:08:31,320 --> 00:08:33,220
I must not intervene here.

131
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,558
This will be a good lesson for Jojo.

132
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:38,268
Overcoming this will
only make him stronger.

133
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:44,750
Huh.

134
00:08:44,920 --> 00:08:46,140
What did I tell you?

135
00:08:46,940 --> 00:08:51,900
My grandfather might still be alive if
your grandfather hadn't gotten his way.

136
00:08:52,340 --> 00:08:53,977
I refuse to accept your kind.

137
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:56,660
Your pathetic blood. That's enough.

138
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:57,857
You've crossed the line now.

139
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:58,770
