Like to see my maneuver sure
to eliminate the Pillar Men?

144
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:11,493
It's a clean technique.

145
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,780
Behold, my Hamon Baby Lanchot.

146
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:20,677
It's important to keep oneself clean.

147
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:24,525
I, myself, have a thin layer of
soap on my clothes at all times!

148
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:27,566
You're looking a little
dirty yourself, there!

149
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:28,530
Joestar!

150
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:43,760
Well, I am impressed that
you're still conscious,

151
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:47,337
but your weak little Hamon
couldn't even pop a bubble.

152
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:48,517
Just look at you.

153
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:52,817
Your breath is already all over
the place enjoy your stage you

154
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:57,120
start and next you'll say now I'll
lift my harm on spell signorina.

155
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,170
Thank you

156
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:02,060
And now I'll lift my
hum on spell signorina.

157
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,150
Thank you

158
00:10:13,060 --> 00:10:15,119
While that woman was throttling me,

159
00:10:15,340 --> 00:10:19,737
I filled a pigeon with as much hamon as
I could and hid it away in her mouth.

160
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:21,260
I knew you'd kiss her,

161
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:25,322
either because you had to withdraw
your hamon or just to show off.

162
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:26,920
So I was right.

163
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:30,045
Turns out that you couldn't
even beat a pigeon.

164
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,840
Ah, what a day.

165
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:48,440
Honestly, just who does
this jerk think he is?

166
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:51,617
Grant's standing like that
just to sit down in a chair.

167
00:10:51,700 --> 00:10:53,920
I really can't stand people like him.

168
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:57,700
If only I had a technique
like his bubble launcher.

169
00:10:58,020 --> 00:11:00,608
I'd be able to teach
him some humility then.

170
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,320
I have to get stronger with my hamon.

171
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,400
But training is always such a hassle.

172
00:11:08,040 --> 00:11:11,393
Let's see how our little friend
handles a game of chance.

173
00:11:12,420 --> 00:11:14,680
I saw that Jojo deal the cards right.

174
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,098
Only cowards cheat.

175
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:17,980
Whatever, do you?

176
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:20,620
Deal the cards properly, Joestar.

177
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,080
Or play elsewhere.

178
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:24,580
Fancy that.

179
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:27,000
Well, that didn't work.

180
00:11:29,140 --> 00:11:29,970
Pathetic.

181
00:11:30,053 --> 00:11:34,377
You should be ashamed that you have to
resort to cheating and gimmicks to beat me.

182
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:36,637
You really are serious about cleanliness.

183
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,280
This mirror is spotless.

184
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,857
Stop provoking me, Joe Star!

185
00:11:39,940 --> 00:11:42,260
Oh, I haven't even started! Calm down!

186
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:45,040
It's been eight hours, Caesar.

187
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,906
Do you mind telling us
what we're waiting for?

188
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,200
What are we waiting for?

189
00:11:52,900 --> 00:11:54,018
Here's your answer.

190
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:01,647
What the hell is a German
soldier doing here?

191
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:04,420
It looks like we're clear.

192
00:12:05,460 --> 00:12:07,989
Just who do you think
guards the Pillowman?

193
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,640
He'll get us in there.

194
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:10,701
Behave yourself.

195
00:12:10,820 --> 00:12:12,560
Again with the Germans?

196
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:56,175
Stop the Pillar Men before they awake.

197
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,620
How's the beauty?

198
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:02,453
Now don't be embarrassed you
have a girlfriend back home.

199
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:04,357
Well, she's...

200
